     "<div dir=\"ltr\">David,<div><br></div><div>I would also suggest posting this to the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer#!forum/shiny-discuss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter%23!forum/shiny-discuss&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363146435000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39bWM2zXDUv1sTG8AnSoYF\">shiny-discuss</a> group which is for questions not directly related to <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363146435000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0GGl04X_-C0XZ1xzIqalUl\">shinyapps.io</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>-Andy</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Sat, Jul 18, 2015 at 10:36 PM, david shanabrook <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dhsh...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I think this is a simple question, so I didn&#39;t include a complete code example.  I am using observeEvent to change inputs, which works fine.  But I also want to trigger this event programmatically, for example, how would I trigger <div><br></div><div>in ui.R</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:12.7px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">actionButton(<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;update&quot;</span>,<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;update&quot;</span>),</p><div><br></div><div>in server.R</div><div><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:12.7px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">observeEvent(<span style=\"color:#000000\">input</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">update</span>, <span style=\"color:#c38809\">function</span>() {</p>\